    "detailed_description": "Fight The Voxelized Zombie Hoards in this FPS online Co-op Survival shooter. Heed The Call of Voxels as you and your friends unlock more areas and powerups as you progress through a vast maze of post apocalyptic ruin. Purchase a gun from the wall or the &quot;random mystery gun chest&quot;. Get your Friends up before they are down for the count... You already know the drill, but now in shiny retro-indie voxel flavors! Every copy comes with standardized, stylized square blood chunk splats. Aim for the head to conserve ammunition!<br><br><br>Join the Playtest By becoming a member of the Zombie Squad Discord<br>",
